                            <p class="font-sans text-weaver-indigo/70 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                                Use one surface for structural queries, patch application, and diagnostics. The daemon streams JSONL to the CLI, which then forwards raw payloads or human-readable output as needed.
                            </p>
                            <a href="/weaver/how-it-works/#fusion" class="inline-flex items-center font-mono text-xs font-bold text-weaver-indigo uppercase tracking-wider group-hover:underline decoration-weaver-vermilion underline-offset-4">
