                                    <span class="text-weaver-vermilion mr-2">➜</span>
                                    <span class="mr-2">~</span>
                                    <span class="text-white">weaver observe get-definition --output json --uri file:///src/main.rs --position 10:5</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-blue-300 mt-2 pl-4 border-l-2 border-blue-500/30">
